From: Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>
Subject: explorer: File Explorer's views, panes and Quick access

View: Extra large, Large, Medium and Small icons, List, Details, Tiles,
Content, remembered per folder with the icon size (Pictures and Videos open in
Large icons, with their pictures). Sort > Group by: Name, Date modified, Type,
Size, (None), remembered per folder. The details pane (Alt+Shift+P: the
picture or icon, name, type, dates, size) and the preview pane (Alt+P: a
picture, or a text file's start). Quick access: its page (the pinned and
frequent folders, then the recent files) and its branch of the navigation
pane (pins, with a pin, then the frequent folders), following the registry so
a pin from any menu shows at once; a folder visited twice is frequent.
Files dragged onto a folder or drive in the navigation pane go there.

